  "harness_bug_found_and_fixed": "The FIRST evaluation run of P7SYS2-Q5 (osimertinib) spuriously showed 2/2 unsupported claims. Root-caused to a bug in this session's OWN scratch evaluation harness (NOT Phase 6, NOT the Candidate B evaluator): a flat global evidence-id-keyed dict silently let a same-evidence_id 'osimertinib_resolve' Evidence object (from a different real ChEMBL adapter call) overwrite the correct 'osimertinib_info' Evidence object, since ChEMBL evidence_ids are keyed by chembl_id alone. Fixed by scoping the evidence lookup to exactly the Evidence objects each query's generation call actually used. Re-run confirmed 2/2 supported. Documented transparently in docs/v2/PHASE7_HARDENING_AUDIT.md rather than silently corrected.",
